            "helpMarkdown": "# Custom State example\n\nThis personal four-category workflow uses the explicit state property: seed, research, draft and published. It remains separate from the built-in five-category Publishing preset, which also recognizes review.\n\n## Example\n\n```yaml\nstate: draft\n```\n\nFocus Start here to inspect actual connected notes. Choose a different layout without changing their states. Deliberate assignment uses the native property preview.\n\n## Limits\n\nA review value is intentionally Unassigned here. Multiple recognized states are Conflicting; unavailable metadata stays Cannot classify. Decorative guides never publish notes or create recorded relationships. No automatic transition or all-vault board is provided.\n",
